<title>USA: Harlan County SDFC, Ky., won by Johnston, Brown.</title>
<headline>Harlan County SDFC, Ky., won by Johnston, Brown.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Johnston, Brown, Burnett &amp; Knight, Inc said it won $1.555 million of Harlan County School District Finance Corporation, Ky., school building refunding revenue bonds, Series of 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.0755 percent.</p>
